OL,3,GNEWSA'My mum was more nervous': Pupils
OL,4,Aacross NI celebrate GCSE results
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm very, very happy," says Precious
OL,7,FOlukanni after opening her GCSE results
OL,8,Fat Integrated College Glengormley.
OL,10,FThe envelope she'd been handed revealed
OL,11,Ftwo A*s, six As and one B.
OL,13,FPrecious was among the 32,000 students
OL,14,Facross Northern Ireland who received
OL,15,Ftheir GCSE results on Thursday.
OL,17,FAlmost a third of entries in Northern
OL,18,FIreland have again been awarded the top
OL,19,FA* and A grades. That is much higher
OL,20,Fthan in England or Wales.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
